{"lyrics":"[00:01.22]Na-na-na, na-na-na-na\n[00:02.38]I ruin everything I touch (Oh-oh)\n[00:06.78]I ruin everything I touch (Oh-oh)\n[00:09.90]I ruin everything I touch, go (Oh-oh)\n[00:13.34]Gold, uh, I ruin everything I touch (Mm-mm-mm)\n[00:23.58]I found out I'm the problem (Mm)\n[00:27.62]I found out I'm the problem (Problem)\n[00:30.02]I ruin everything I touch, uh (I touch, yeah)\n[00:33.88]I think I ran out of options (Options), I just hope I don't run out of your love (Love, oh), uh (Mm)\n[00:40.86]See you, you're really awesome (Awesome)\n[00:43.42]But me, I'm still stuck in the mud (Mud, yeah)\n[00:47.60]The opposite of Midas (Midas), I ruin everything I touch (I touch)\n[00:54.34]You really had a point when you said it (Said it)\n[00:57.50]But I wonder if you meant it (Meant it), uh\n[01:01.14]I know I'm really fucked up in the head, hell yeah (Hell yeah)\n[01:03.66]Sometimes I feel demented (Sometimes I feel demented, demented)\n[01:07.74]But I know that my love's so true, truer than the truth, that's facts (That's facts)\n[01:12.74]I done crossed the line with you (I done crossed the line with you)\n[01:16.72]So that means there ain't no turning back (So that means there ain't no turning back, yeah), uh\n[01:21.76]I rip my heart up out of my chest and put it on a song (On a song)\n[01:25.00]I never write the songs I make, 'cause I be righting wrongs (Righting wrongs)\n[01:28.12]Bae, am I right or wrong? (Bae, am I right or wrong?)\n[01:30.08]I know you hate the things I say, so you don't sing along, oh (I know you hate the things I say, so you don't sing along)\n[01:35.16]I'm having panic attacks, I'm going through it (I'm having panic attacks, I'm going through it)\n[01:38.86]I try to keep my composure for the two of us (I try to keep my composure for the two of us)\n[01:42.36]You don't need to see me like that (That, girl)\n[01:45.88]I break everything that I touch (Touch, oh)\n[01:48.18]I found out I'm the problem (Problem)\n[01:51.00]I ruin everything I touch, uh (I touch, yeah)\n[01:54.44]I think I ran out of options (Options), I just hope I don't run out of your love (Love, oh), uh (Mm)\n[02:01.42]See you, you're really awesome (Awesome)\n[02:03.98]But me, I'm still stuck in the mud (Mud, yeah)\n[02:06.28]The opposite of Midas (Midas), I ruin everything I touch (I touch)\n[02:14.86]That had me feeling useless (Woah), that had me feeling really fucked up, yeah (Woah-oh)\n[02:21.76]I thought I made you happy (Woah), I'm guessing that I'm not enough, hmm (Woah-oh)\n[02:28.38]And I've been chain-smoking (Woah-oh), I'm really starting to stress myself out (Woah-oh)\n[02:33.88]I put the Percs down and pick your heart up (Oh-oh), so, baby girl, don't count me out (Ooh-oh-oh)\n[02:40.74]I've been struggling, tossing and turning up in my sleep, if I sleep at all (Oh-oh)\n[02:46.98]Happiness is something that I thought would never ever achieve, but with you here, I achieve that all (Ooh-oh)\n[02:55.70]I fall apart at every sign of commotion (Oh-oh)\n[02:59.06]I'm rocking back and forth, like I'm in the ocean, fetal position, need an asylum, I need assistance\n[03:08.66]I found out I'm the problem (Problem)\n[03:11.56]I ruin everything I touch, uh (I touch, yeah)\n[03:15.00]I think I ran out of options (Options), I just hope I don't run out of your love (Love, oh), uh (Mm)\n[03:21.98]See you, you're really awesome (Awesome)\n[03:24.54]But me, I'm still stuck in the mud (Mud, yeah)\n[03:28.92]The opposite of Midas (Midas), I ruin everything I touch (I touch)\n[03:34.82]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[03:38.16]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[03:41.48]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[03:44.84]Hold me (Oh)\n[04:02.52]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[04:05.18]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[04:06.46]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[04:08.54]Hold me, yeah\n[04:09.22]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[04:11.52]Hold my hand, tell me that it's okay\n[04:12.80]Hold my hand, tell me tha